  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given figure, the emf of the cell is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;and if internal resistance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. Calculate the power dissipated in the whole circuit:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d7958c7f-3119-4521-8ec9-b8cd04526b7a-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 266px;\" /></p>",
