  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The above circuit in the question is arranged like that, so all the resistance are connected in parallel and the net resistance of the parallel resistor becomes,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ca34200a-b78a-4e50-9002-798e20e3ddfc-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 255px;\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>48</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1d1a6e8a-d1ee-40b5-867c-a0e68ff3ff28-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 194px;\" /></p><p>Now the net resistance will be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>48</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>, so the net power,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math></p>",
